  {
   "say": "Bethlehem: eighty six percent Christian in 1950. By 2016, about twelve."
  },
  {
   "say": "And it's not just Bethlehem."
  },
  {
   "say": "Iraq had one and a half million Christians before 2003, by Christian leaders' count."
  },
  {
   "say": "Today, fewer than two hundred thousand."
  },
  {
   "say": "In 2014, ISIS, the Islamic State group, took Mosul and told Christians: convert, pay, or die.",
