   "at": "L4:convert",
   "until": "L5"
  },
  {
   "say": "Now the region: the Christian share of each country, before the wars and today."
  },
  {
   "say": "Syria: one in ten before the war. Now, about two percent."
  },
  {
   "say": "Iraq: about six percent, down to under half a percent."
  },
  {
   "say": "Lebanon: from a third to twenty eight percent."
  },
  {
   "say": "Israel's share slipped too: two percent to one point nine."
  },
  {
   "say": "One place the number keeps growing: Israel. Thirty six thousand Christians in 1950. One hundred eighty four thousand today."
  },
  {
   "say": "And Arab Christians in Israel start degrees more often than Hebrew school graduates.",
   "screen": "Arab Christians starting a degree within *8* years of school",
   "at": "L11",
   "until": "L12"
  },
  {
   "say": "Israel isn't perfect. In 2023, extremists spat at Christian pilgrims in Jerusalem. Netanyahu called it a desecration."
  },
  {
   "say": "So next time someone asks about Middle East Christians, start here:"
